# The reference PDFs that were dropped in the project root (screen captures,
# scratch downloads) stay out of the repo...
*.pdf
# ...but the gated floor plans are application data. /api/floorplans reads them
# off disk at request time, so if they are not committed the download route
# returns 500 in production.
!assets/floorplans/*.pdf

